OL,3,ACovid inquiry rejects ministers' claims
OL,4,Aof 'protective ring' around care homes
OL,5,Aat start of pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters' claims of there being a
OL,8,F"protective ring" around care homes at
OL,9,Fthe start of Covid were unfounded,
OL,10,Faccording to the Covid inquiry
OL,12,FThe latest report - on the UK's adult
OL,13,Fsocial care sector - says it appeared
OL,14,Fto be "something of an afterthought" in
OL,15,Fthe early stages of the pandemic
OL,17,FIt says when patients were moved from
OL,18,Fhospitals to care homes initially there
OL,19,Fwas no recommendation to isolate new
OL,20,Farrivals, which it called "a
OL,21,Fsignificant omission"
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
