OL,3,AGoogle Cloud outage hits online
OL,4,Aservices including banks and court
OL,5,Avideo links
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle says "multiple" Cloud services
OL,8,Fare suffering network failures
OL,10,F"We are experiencing an issue with
OL,11,Fmultiple services in europe-west2," the
OL,12,Fcompany says, adding that issues began
OL,13,Faround 07:00 BST
OL,15,FOnline bank Revolut, delivery service
OL,16,FDPD and Royal Mail are among the
OL,17,Fbusinesses reporting issues, according
OL,18,Fto Downdetector - here are some others
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
