OL,3,AChancellor rejects calls to raise
OL,4,ACapital Gains Tax in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move followed warnings that it
OL,7,Fcould end up costing the government
OL,8,Fmoney if wealthy people leave the
OL,9,Fcountry or defer selling off assets.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
