OL,3,AAlbertans have made 'clear choice' to
OL,4,Aremain part of Canada, says PM Mark
OL,5,ACarney
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,8,Fsays Albertans have made "a clear
OL,9,Fchoice" to reject independence
OL,11,FThe province was deciding whether to
OL,12,Fremain part of Canada, or move forward
OL,13,Fwith an independence referendum - early
OL,14,Ffigures show around three quarters of
OL,15,Fvoters voted to stay with Canada
OL,17,F"Alberta chose Canada," Carney says -
OL,18,Fread his statement in full here
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
