OL,3,ASuspect arrested after historic town
OL,4,Ahall set alight during disorder -
OL,5,AFrench media
OL,6,
OL,7,FA suspect linked to a far-left movement
OL,8,Fhas been arrested in France after a
OL,9,F19th Century city hall was gutted by a
OL,10,Ffire over the weekend that broke out
OL,11,Fduring mass disorder, French media
OL,12,Freport.
OL,14,FThe clock tower and parts of the roof
OL,15,Fof the ornate city hall in the central
OL,16,Fcity of Limoges were engulfed in flames
OL,17,Fbefore collapsing on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
