OL,3,ASuspect arrested after historic town
OL,4,Ahall set alight during disorder -
OL,5,AFrench media
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 40-year-old suspect is known for
OL,8,Facts of violence against public
OL,9,Fofficials and has been classified as an
OL,10,F"S" subject, meaning he is a potential
OL,11,Fthreat to national security, FranceInfo
OL,12,Freported.
OL,14,FMore than 120 people have already been
OL,15,Fimprisoned following widespread
OL,16,Fdemonstrations across France, French
OL,17,FJustice Minister Gerald Darmanin told
OL,18,FCNews-Europe.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
