OL,3,ASeventh day of violent clashes between
OL,4,AAlbanian protesters and police
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters in Albania have fought with
OL,7,Friot police on the seventh consecutive
OL,8,Fday of violent clashes.
OL,10,FThe protesters, many of them high
OL,11,Fschool and university students, are
OL,12,Ftrying to oust embattled Prime Minister
OL,13,FEdi Rama. Official figures said 295
OL,14,Fpeople have been injured, 186 of whom
OL,15,Fare police officers, before Monday's
OL,16,Fviolence.
OL,18,F"The moment the state negotiates with
OL,19,Fthis," Rama told grim-faced police
OL,20,Fchiefs, brandishing a rock hurled at
OL,21,Fpolice on Sunday, "the state has
OL,22,Ffallen".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
